<title>BELGIUM: City-Bird adds a second MD-11 to its fleet.</title>
<headline>City-Bird adds a second MD-11 to its fleet.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian airline City-Bird has added a second MD-11 to its fleet, an airline spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The company's second MD-11 entered service on June 2 on services from Belgium to the U.S.</p>
<p>City-Bird operates services four-times-a-week to New York, twice-weekly to Los Angeles and once-a-week to San Francisco.</p>
<p>Swisscargo has bought the freight capacity on the MD-11 flights. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
